    "content": "$ETH IS DEFENDING A CRITICAL SUPPORT ZONE FOR AN UPSIDE MOVE 🔥\n\nEntry: 1574 - 1577 🔥\nTarget: 1586 🚀\nStop Loss: 1567 ⚠️\n\nETH is forming a base above an important support level, with buyers stepping in after the recent decline. As long as price holds above 1567, the upside recovery remains valid. Volume is picking up on the 4H chart and the structure points to a potential sweep of the 1574 zone before a move higher.\n\nThis level has been defended multiple times over the past week, each test attracting aggressive bids. Momentum is shifting as we approach active trading hours. Are you adding to longs here or waiting for a deeper retest?\n\nNot financial advice. Always manage your risk.\n\n#ETH #LongSetup #Ethereum #Support #Crypto \n\n🔥",
